      {
        "type": "heading",
        "size": 6,
        "defaultValue": "<b>NOTE:</b><br/> Background Worker runs an app permanently in the background.  Pebble only allows one background worker at a time.<br/><br/>If you toggle this off, it uses wakeup timers instead on the start of the hour and in the reminder minute timeframe you set.  Any other app you have open during this time will be closed and it may fail to schedule if other apps are using wakeup timers in the same minute.  It also will only show the steps complete reward if you have the app open already."
